85Gtier:\u001b[91Git\u001b[94Gfixes\u001b[100Gthe\u001b[104Gshape\u001b[110Gof\u001b[113Gcommands\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gand gets more expensive once more than one player send\u001b[62Gcommands. The server would decide each call's context, so\u001b[K\r\u001b[6C\u001b[1B player's handler \u001b[26Gends as that player and an NPC's a\u001b[62Gthat NPC\u001b[72GIt would als\u001b[85G stamp \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mSim::Controller\u001b[108G\u001b[39mvalu\u001b[113Gs ne\u001b[118Gted\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Binside a command's\u001b[25Gfields, which\u001b[39Gthe host \u001b[49Goesn't do\u001b[59Gyet.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B2.\u001b[6G\u001b[1mEncryption.\u001b[22m It's well specified and self-contained, and Manifest\u001b[71Gwill\u001b[76Gneed\u001b[81Git\u001b[84Gbefore\u001b[91Gany\u001b[95Gpublic\u001b[102Ghosting.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3\u001b[6G\u001b[1mThe way i\u001b[16G to a pad, done properly.\u001b[42G\u001b[22mThis is first in the \"Then\" tier,\u001b[76Gand every NPC and autop\u001b[100Glot trade in\u001b[113GManifest\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6Gdocks through it. The fix is an approach\u001b[76Glaps\u001b[81Gs when a\u001b[90Gship s\u001b[99Gs making progress,\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
