[0.006, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[6G\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m✻\u001b[3GCrunched for 19s · done 1:05 pm\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLet's work on the documentation. I want you to thoroughly review all the files in ./docs. Compare their statements \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255magainst the ground truth of the code.\u001b[39m                                                                                 \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mTake any documentation on roadmap items that can now be archived and move it into the history.md file. Check the \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mnumbering and ordering of the tasks in the backlog or deferred decisions and re-order and re-number them all.\u001b[39m         \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mEach major feature of the engine and manifest need to have their own top level document in their /docs folders. There\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mshould be an index document in the same folder that links to them and a brief description of their purpose or \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcontents.\u001b[39m                                                                                                             \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLook for places where concept and ideas are repeated, along with definitions, and move them to a single place which \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mis referred to with links from any areas that need to mention them.\u001b[39m                                                   \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mExamine the prose for readability by a person. I want it to be clear, consise, direct, but also explain concepts \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mfully. Use mermaid diagrams for topics that benefit from a visual approach.\u001b[39m                                           \r\u001b[2B\u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m*\u001b[3GScurrying… \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Double-tap esc to rewind the code and/or conversation to a previous point in time\r\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0028 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[38C\u001b[3B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · esc to interrupt · ← 1 agent\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
[0.013, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[13C\u001b[19B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Tracking ponytail mode...… · 0s)\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
