[0.019, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLet's work on the documentation. I want you to thoroughly review all the files in ./docs. Compare their statements \u001b[39m   \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255magainst the ground tr\u001b[25Gth of the code.\u001b[39m                                                                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mTake any documentation on roadmap items that can now be archived and move it into the history.md file. Check the \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bnumbering and order\u001b[23Gng\u001b[27Gf\u001b[29Gthe t\u001b[35Gsks in the ba\u001b[49Gklog or deferred \u001b[67Gecisions and\u001b[80Gre-\u001b[84Grder\u001b[89Gand re-number them all.\u001b[39m    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                                                             \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mEach major feature of the engine and manifest need to have their own top level document in their /docs folders. There\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bshould be an index\u001b[22Gdocum\u001b[28Gnt in the sa\u001b[41Ge folder that links to them a\u001b[71Gd a brief des\u001b[85Gription of their purpose o\u001b[112G \u001b[39m       \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcontents.\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLook for places where concept and ideas are repeated, along with definitions, and move them to a single place which \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bis re\u001b[9Ge\u001b[11Gred to with links from any areas that n\u001b[51Ged to\u001b[57Gmention \u001b[67Gem.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mExamine the prose for readability by a person. I want it to be clear, consise, direct, but also explain concepts \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfully. Use me\u001b[17Gmaid diagr\u001b[28Gms for topics\u001b[42Gthat benefit from\u001b[60Ga visua\u001b[68G \u001b[70Gpproach.\u001b[39m                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mReading\u001b[11G\u001b[1m2\u001b[13G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[20Glisting\u001b[28G\u001b[1m4\u001b[30G\u001b[22mdirectories…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  $ ls ../manifest ../manifest/source 2>/dev/null\u001b[39m\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
