[0.005, "o", "\u001b[H\r\u001b[14C\u001b[11B ☒ Granularity \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ☐ Stage plans \r\u001b[2B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[2m│\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mMan\u001b[7Gf\u001b[9Gst's finished stage plans (1–5, ~4,200 lines) are mostly completed work. Where should it go?\r\u001b[5C\u001b[2B\u001b[22m\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mInt\u001b[10G history.md\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mAs you\u001b[13Gsaid: fold the finished\u001b[37Gparts \u001b[44Gnto\u001b[48Ghistory.md (it\u001b[63Ggrows to ~6–7k lines); the live c\u001b[97Gntracts they define move\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Binto th\u001b[14G f\u001b[17Gature docs.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m2.\u001b[6G\u001b[39mhistory/\u001b[15Gfolder\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B  \u001b[6G\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mhistory.md stays an index; each closed stage's record becomes docs/history/stage-N.md.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B3. Type something.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m  4. Chat about this\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mEnter to select · Tab/Arrow keys to navigate · Esc to cancel\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[16;1H"]
