[0.006, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mL\u001b[5Gok for places where concept and ideas are repeated, along with definitions, and move them to a single place which \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bis referred to with links from any areas that need to mention them.\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                                                                    \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mExamin\u001b[10G the\u001b[15Gprose for readability by a person. I want\u001b[57Git \u001b[61Go be clear, consise, direct, but also explain concepts \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfully. Use mermaid diagrams for topics that benefit from a visual approach.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[39m Searching for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m patterns, reading \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, listing \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m directories, running \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 1m 19s\u001b[39m…\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/.claude/projects/-home-ivan-projects-jettison/01ddcc12-00f3-49e6-9929-9ac9ba26f113/tool-results/bbzziuxsl.txt\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m←  ☒ Task IDs  ☒ Granularity  ☒ Stage plans  ☒ Commits \u001b[48;2;177;185;249m\u001b[38;2;0;0;0m ✔ Submit \u001b[49m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m →\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255m\u001b[1mReview your answers\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[2m│\u001b[4G\u001b[22m●\u001b[6GManifest's\u001b[17Gtasks\u001b[23Gcarry\u001b[29Gan\u001b[32Gorder\u001b[38Gand\u001b[42Gan\u001b[45GID\u001b[48G(\"34b\u001b[54G/\u001b[56GW16\").\u001b[63GThe\u001b[67GIDs\u001b[71Gare\u001b[75Gcited\u001b[81Gin\u001b[84G37\u001b[87Gcode/data/script\u001b[104Gfiles\u001b[110G