[0.008, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[4G\u001b[38;2;255;255;255met's work on the docume\u001b[28Gtation. I want\u001b[43Gyou\u001b[47Gto thorough\u001b[59Gy rev\u001b[65Gew\u001b[68Gall the files in\u001b[85G./docs. Compare their\u001b[107Gst\u001b[110Gt\u001b[112Gments \u001b[39m \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255magainst the\u001b[15Gground truth o\u001b[30G the code.\u001b[39m                              \r\u001b[2C\u001b[2B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mTake any documentation on roadmap\u001b[37Gitems that can\u001b[52Gnow be archived and move \u001b[78Gt into the his\u001b[93Gory.md fi\u001b[103Ge. Check the\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bn\u001b[5Gmbering and ordering of the tasks in\u001b[44Ge backlog or deferred decisions and re-order and re-number them all.\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mEach major feature of the engine and manifest need to have their own top level document in their /docs folders. There\u001b[39m \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mshould be an index document in the same folder that links to them and a brief description of their purpose or \u001b[39m        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcontents.\u001b[39m                                                                                                             \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLook for places where concept and ideas are repeated, along with definitions, and move them to a single place which \u001b[39m  \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mis referred to with links from any areas that need to mention them.\u001b[39m                                                   \r\u001b[1B                                                                                                                        \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mExamine the prose for readability by a person. I want it to be clear, consise, direct, but also explain concepts \u001b[39m     \r\u001b[1B  \u001b[38;2;255;255;255mfully. Use mermaid diagrams for topics that benefit from a visual approach.\u001b[39m                                           \r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m \u001b[3G\u001b[39mSearching for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m patterns, reading\u001b[37G\u001b[1m2\u001b[39G\u001b[22mfiles,\u001b[46Glisting\u001b[54G\u001b[1m4\u001b[56G\u001b[22mdirectories,\u001b[69Grunning\u001b[77G\u001b[1m1\u001b[79G\u001b[22mshell\u001b[85Gcommand\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · 1m 20s\u001b[39m…\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  ~/.claude/projects/-home-ivan-projects-jettison/01ddcc12-00f3-49e6-9929-9ac9ba26f113/tool-results/bbzziuxsl.txt\r\u001b[3C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m✢\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;218;124;92mScurrying…\u001b[38;2;215;119;87m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(Ask the user the key scoping questions · 41s · ↓\u001b[39m \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m3.6k tokens)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  Tip: Double-tap esc to rewind the code and/or conversation to a previous point in time\r\u001b[1C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0028 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39mGive\u001b[8Gexamples\u001b[17Gof\u001b[20Gusage\u001b[26Gwhen\u001b[31Gappropriate\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m\u001b[2mOpus 5.5 ctx [----------] 7% | 5h: 0% | ↑65.1k ↓1.6k\r\u001b[1B\u001b[22m\u001b[39m  \u001b[38;2;255;193;7m⏵⏵ auto mode on\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m · \u001b[38;2;0;204;