[0.036, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[3G\u001b[48;2;55;55;55m\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mcontents.\u001b[39m                                                                                                     \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B         \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mLook for places where concept and ideas are repeated, along with definitions, and move them to a single place which \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bis re\u001b[9Ge\u001b[11Gred to with links from any areas that n\u001b[51Ged to\u001b[57Gmention \u001b[67Gem.\u001b[39m                                                 \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B                                                                   \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;255;255;255mExamine the prose for readability by a person. I want it to be clear, consise, direct, but also explain concepts \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1Bfully. Use me\u001b[17Gmaid diagr\u001b[28Gms for topics\u001b[42Gthat benefit from\u001b[60Ga visua\u001b[68G \u001b[70Gpproach.\u001b[39m                                      \r\u001b[1B\u001b[49m\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153mSearched for \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m patterns, read \u001b[1m2\u001b[22m files, listed \u001b[1m4\u001b[22m directories, ran \u001b[1m1\u001b[22m shell command \r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m●\u001b[3G\u001b[39mAnswered\u001b[12GClaude's\u001b[21Gquestions:\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m  ⎿  · Manifest's tasks carry an order and an ID (\"34b / W16\"). The IDs are cited in 37 code/data/script files and in \r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m     \u001b[38;2;153;153;153mcommit messages. How far\u001b[31Gshoul\u001b[37G \u001b[39Genumbering\u001b[50Ggo? →\u001b[56GOrder only (Recommended)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· How fine should the per-feature top-level\u001b[50Gd\u001b[52Gcuments be? → Major features (Recommended)\r\u001b[7C\u001b[1BMani\u001b[13Gest'\u001b[18G finished\u001b[28Gstage plans\u001b[40G(1–5, ~4,200 lines)\u001b[60Gare\u001b[64Gmostly complet\u001b[79Gd\u001b[81Gwork. Wher\u001b[92G should it go? → history/ \r\u001b[5C\u001b[1Bfolder\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m· Both repos' docs change heavily. How should the work land? → Commit per repo\r\u001b[5C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;240;165;37m\u001b[1m·\u001b[3G\u001b[22mScurrying… \u001b[38;2;153;153;153m(1m 2s · ↓\u001b[25G5.3k tokens · \u001b[38;2;221;182;66mstill thinking with high effort\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m)\r\u001b[1B  ⎿  Tip: Double-tap esc to rewind the code and/or conversation to a previous point in time\r\u001b[1B\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;136;136;136m──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── jettison-0028 ─\r\u001b[1B\u001b[38;2;153;153;153m❯ \u001b[39mGive examples of usage when appropriate. Use the history folder idea you just posed to me for jettison as well, it's\u001b[K\r\u001b[1B\u001b[K\u001b[27;1H\u001b[24;3H\u001b[?25h"]
