[0.086, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5GThere are 18 feature documents, from\u001b[42GSimulation through The\u001b[65Gapp shell\u001b[75Gand tools. \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mglossary.md\u001b[39m defines about 1\u001b[114G0 terms\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bonce,\u001b[12Gnd\u001b[15Gother documents link to it.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mDiagrams and examples.\u001b[22m There are 51 mermaid\u001b[49Gdiagrams,\u001b[59Gall\u001b[63Gchecked\u001b[71Gwith\u001b[76G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mmmdc\u001b[39m,\u001b[82Gand\u001b[86Gthe\u001b[90Gexamples\u001b[99Gcome\u001b[104Gfrom\u001b[109Gthe\u001b[113Gtests,\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gthe ground sample and the t\u001b[33Gst content.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mNo duplicates.\u001b[22m R\u001b[22Gpeated \u001b[30Gxplanations are\u001b[46Gcut\u001b[50Gto\u001b[53Ga\u001b[55Glink\u001b[60Gto\u001b[63Gtheir\u001b[69Gone\u001b[73Ghome,\u001b[79Gand\u001b[83Gevery\u001b[89Glink\u001b[94Gresolves.\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mBacklog renumbered J01–J29\u001b[22m in pr\u001b[39Grity order, with stable\u001b[63Ganchors. T\u001b[74Ge space-gam\u001b[86G items moved out to\u001b[106G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mfor-manifest.md\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m \u001b[5Gin my scratch folder, for Ma\u001b[34Gifest's backlog.\u001b[51G\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mHistory folder.\u001b[22m \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mhistory.md\u001b[39m is now the index of\u001b[52G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdocs/history/\u001b[39m.\u001b[67GThe\u001b[71Gfinished\u001b[80Gplans\u001b[86Gare\u001b[90Garchived\u001b[99Gthere,\u001b[106Galong\u001b[112Gwith\u001b[117Gthe\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gretired decisions and the notes moved\u001b[43Gout of the reference docum\u001b[70Gnts.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mCode comments.\u001b[22m About 115 files that cited\u001b[48Gld doc sections\u001b[64Gn\u001b[66Gw point to\u001b[77Gthe\u001b[81Gnew\u001b[85Gones,\u001b[91Gand\u001b[95Gthe\u