[0.447, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mThings to know\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m- \u001b[1mThe docs are longer.\u001b[26G\u001b[22mThe\u001b[30Gnon-history\u001b[42Gdocs\u001b[47Gwent\u001b[52Gfrom\u001b[57Gabout\u001b[63G5,300\u001b[69Glines\u001b[75Gto\u001b[78Gabout\u001b[84G12,000.\u001b[92GThe\u001b[96Gediting\u001b[104Gpasses\u001b[111Gonly\u001b[116Gcut\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5G6–9% of the words, because most of what remains is examples\u001b[65G tab\u001b[70Ges and diagrams. If you want \u001b[100Ghem\u001b[104Gshorter, a pass\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1Bthat\u001b[10Gtrims the examples is\u001b[32Gthe lever.\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[1mI didn't run the full gate.\u001b[22m The code changes\u001b[50Gare\u001b[54Gcomments\u001b[63Gonly.\u001b[69GThe\u001b[73Gformat\u001b[80Gcheck\u001b[86Gpasses,\u001b[94Gand\u001b[98G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mcomment-only.sh\u001b[114G\u001b[39mflags\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gonly three edits outside code comments: a CSS comment, \u001b[61Ghe \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mdevenv.nix\u001b[39m line, and a string\u001b[94Gi\u001b[96G \u001b[38;2;177;185;249mCheckNeutra\u001b[109GWords.cmake\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[39m(its\u001b[10G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249mneutral_words\u001b[39m \u001b[25Gest still\u001b[35Gpass\u001b[40Gs).\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B-\u001b[5G\u001b[38;2;177;185;249m\u001b[1mAGENTS.md\u001b[39m still repeats\u001b[30G\u001b[22mome build-and-gates\u001b[50Ghow-tos\u001b[58G(tidy,\u001b[65Gcapture,\u001b[74Gmemory).\u001b[83GI\u001b[85Gleft\u001b[90Gthem\u001b[95Gbecause\u001b[103Gthat\u001b[108Gfile\u001b[113Gis\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B \u001b[5Gloaded every session.\u001b[K\r\u001b[4C\u001b[1B\u001b[K\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[1mQuestions the review raised (none block the work)\r\u001b[2C\u001b[1B\u001b[22m1. Should J09, the way in to a berth, move a\u001b[75Gifest\u001b[81GNPC\u001b[85Gdocks\u001b[91Gthrough\u001b[99Git?\u001b[27;1H\u001b[17;3H\u001b